- [ ] Correct file naming (lowercase, underscores)
- [ ] H1 present exactly once, first line
- [ ] All code blocks have `title` attribute
- [ ] All links use relative paths with `.md`
- [ ] All images in `docs/assets/images/` with alt text
- [ ] Page in `nav:` tree in `mkdocs.yml`
- [ ] Build: 0 errors, 0 warnings
- [ ] Page renders correctly in browser
- [ ] Lists use hyphens, not asterisks
- [ ] No H4+ headings
- [ ] Tone is active, imperative, concise
